    "enterprise.consultant_route_event_2b.text": "A bad review appears for a company with the same name and a different comma.",
    "enterprise.ending_agency.text": "The Careful Agency\n\nThe first client's trust becomes a referral, then a team, then a business that can survive your day off.",
    "enterprise.ending_bankruptcy.text": "The Permanent Line Item\n\nDebt becomes the only reliable customer. You close the company and keep the lessons that cannot be invoiced.",
    "enterprise.ending_consultant.text": "The Independent Consultant\n\nThe calendar fills, the invoices clear, and the company stays small enough to recognize itself.",
    "enterprise.ending_platform_company.text": "The Platform Bet\n\nYou turn repeated client work into a product. The roadmap becomes longer and the margins become possible.",
    "enterprise.ending_sale.text": "The Timely Sale\n\nThe warning helps you recognize a fair offer before desperation sets the price. You sign and pay everyone.",
    "enterprise.ending_successful_company.text": "The Durable Company\n\nRevenue, process, and people finally reinforce each other. Growth stops feeling like falling upward.",
